{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"URPD at block height or date"},"description":"Bitcoin: URPD (UTXO realized price distribution: how much supply last moved at each price) for a cohort at a block height or the last block of a UTC day. Returns `{ height, hash, date, cohort, weight, aggregation, close, supply, buckets }` where `buckets` is columns, `{ price, supply, realized_cap, unrealized_pnl }`, one entry per bucket in ascending price: the same block header and columnar layout as `GET /api/utxo-set/{point}`. `close`, `price`, `realized_cap`, and `unrealized_pnl` are USD; `supply` is BTC. `unrealized_pnl` can be negative. Bucket `realized_cap` and `unrealized_pnl` value each coin at its creation price on the price grid (four significant digits of the price in cents, within 0.05% of the exact price), rounded to the cent per bucket, so the buckets need not sum to the realized cap series. With a `wakefulness` or `mobility` `weight`, `supply` is the weighted supply (whole satoshis) and the bucket values follow it.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"Date":{"description":"Calendar date in YYYY-MM-DD format.","examples":["2009-01-03","2024-04-20"],"format":"date","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"Height":{"description":"A block height: how many blocks came before it.","examples":[0,210000,420000,840000],"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agg":{"default":"raw","description":"Aggregation strategy. Default: raw (no aggregation).","enum":["raw","lin200","lin500","lin1000","log10","log50","log100","log200","log500","log1000","log2000"],"type":"string"},"cohort":{"description":"A URPD cohort, by its series' prefix: an age aggregate (`all`, `sth`, `lth`, `age_under_4m`, ...) or an age band (`age_under_1h`, `age_1h_to_1d`, ...).","enum":["all","sth","lth","age_under_4m","age_under_6m","age_over_4m","